      "Language": "pol",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "With the obesity epidemic, we observe increase in the number of people suffering from diabetes mellitus type 2. This illness is considered cardiovascular disease equivalent, so influence of drugs used to manage diabetes on cardiovascular outcomes is important. Below we present review of main class of drugs used in diabetes treatment and summingup of trials conducted with their use to evaluate cardiovascular risk during treatment."},
